sequenceDiagram
 participant R as Request
 participant S as Scheduler
 participant M as Model
 R->>S: Prompt token IDs
 S->>M: Prefill prompt
 M-->>S: KV and logits
 S-->>R: First sampled token
 loop Until stop
 S->>M: Decode new position with KV
 M-->>S: Updated KV and logits
 S-->>R: Next sampled token
 end
